# No SPA catch-all rule here, on purpose.
# Cloudflare Pages ignores `/* /index.html 200` (it detects an infinite loop).
# Without a 404.html, Pages serves index.html with 200 for unmatched paths
# (built-in SPA mode); the client router renders its own NotFound page.
# Per-route preview pages (e.g. /events/<slug>) are real files from build:pages.
# /api/* and /confirm are Worker routes and never reach Pages.
